OL,3,GNEWSA'I don't feel alone any more': The
OL,4,Aproject helping people overcome
OL,5,Ahoarding
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It is not just the decluttering
OL,8,Fjourney that is important, but
OL,9,Fdecluttering my mind and finding out
OL,10,Fwho I am".
OL,12,FThe words of Pat, 77 who, after decades
OL,13,Fof hoarding, has been getting help from
OL,14,Fa specialist therapeutic project called
OL,15,FRecovering Homes, run by Reaching CIC.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
