OL,3,GNEWSA'I don't feel alone any more': The
OL,4,Aproject helping people overcome
OL,5,Ahoarding
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt includes a hoarding clinic and
OL,8,Ffortnightly peer support, along with
OL,9,Fhelp in the home from a
OL,10,Fpsychotherapist, and has directly
OL,11,Fassisted around 150 people in north
OL,12,FStaffordshire with what CEO Georgina
OL,13,FSalt describes as a "hidden" but
OL,14,Fgrowing issue.
OL,16,F"We're really busy, we have multiple
OL,17,Freferrals a week," said Salt, adding
OL,18,Fthat this involves people who only
OL,19,Freach out when they get to crisis
OL,20,Fpoint.
